        "ephanna"
      ],
      "context_support_ratio": 1.0,
      "failure_surface": "synthesis_gap",
      "stage_loss_tokens": {
        "bonogo": "evidence_gap",
        "caelynn": "evidence_gap",
        "thalia": "hit",
        "wolf": "hit",
        "guards": "hit",
        "ephanna": "evidence_gap"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The fight in the council chamber involves the Players, the Wolf, Thalia, and multiple Guards; council members are not explicitly confirmed present in the projection.\n\nHere\u2019s who is actually in the chamber based on OBSERVED/CANON facts:\n\n- Players (group): Present and actively engaged; \u201cParty is actively in battle.\u201d\n- the Wolf: Explicitly in the \u201cCouncil Room\u201d and central to the encounter.\n- Thalia: Present in the chamber; \u201cWolf is standing at Thalia\u2019s shoulder,\u201d and she participates in combat (including attacking and issuing commands).\n- Guards: Multiple guards are present and/or arriving; they are \u201calerted\u2026 stopping people outside Council Chambers\u201d and \u201cguards are being drawn here as reinforcements,\u201d with some directly engaging in combat.\n\nNotably absent:\n- Council members are not explicitly confirmed as present during the fight in OBSERVED or CANON facts. While the players interact with the council in governance scenes, their presence during the combat is not established here.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Geography: Large circular chamber with central table and high ceilings; contains hidden trapdoor.\n- Defenses: Illusory walls, runes, and magical wards actively affecting the battle.\n- Atmosphere: \u201calmost the entire room is lit up by Fireball,\u201d disheveled, chaotic.\n- Reinforcements: Guards are being drawn into the chamber \u05d1\u05de\u05d4\u05dc\u05da the fight.",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_longmont_campaign_general_notes_1",
      "question": "Who are the Shepherds, and what god or power do they answer to?",
      "strict_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "semantic_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "must_hits": [
        "shepherds",
        "maelthor",
        "cult"
      ],
      "semantic_must_hits": [
