      "answer": "TL;DR: Torrin represents the Guilds (Master Smith), Rurik oversees infrastructure (Chief Architect), and Merril\u2019s council role is not specified in the projection.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Torrin Flamescale (OBSERVED/CANON)\n  - Role: Representative of the Guilds; Master Smith\n  - Rank/Title: Master Smith; Representative of the Guilds\n  - Function on Council: Speaks for craft guilds and industry interests; practical, blunt voice on city issues\n\n- Rurik Stonehammer (CANON/OBSERVED)\n  - Role: Representative of Infrastructure\n  - Rank/Title: Chief Architect\n  - Function on Council: Responsible for the city\u2019s structural integrity, defenses, and knowledge of layout (including hidden passages/sewers)\n\n- Merril\n  - No data found in projection regarding role, title, or council function\n\nIf Merril exists in your notes, their council job isn\u2019t captured here, so you\u2019ll need to reference outside this projection.",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
