      "answer": "TL;DR: The Wolf is **dead** \u2014 specifically **\u201cDecapitated; head removed from body\u201d** \u2014 and there\u2019s no evidence his corruption was resolved before death.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Physical Condition (OBSERVED): **\u201cDecapitated; head removed from body\u201d; \u201cWolf has an oily sheen to his eyes.\u201d**\n- Operational Status (OBSERVED): Was escaping invisibly prior to being stopped\n- Mental State (OBSERVED): Desperate, \u201cbegging to be killed,\u201d showing regret\n- Faction / Alignment (OBSERVED): Cultist; corrupted influence present\n- Related Action (OBSERVED, Bonogo): **\u201cRemoved the Wolf\u2019s head to transport it\u201d**\n\nConclusion:\nAt the end of Session 12, the Wolf is unequivocally dead due to decapitation. The presence of the \u201coily sheen to his eyes\u201d indicates he was still corrupted at the time of death, and nothing in the projection indicates that corruption was lifted or resolved before the killing.",
